4587784	2025-11-19 19:00:00	Fergs Entertainment Complex presents: BLACK FLAG with special guests THE QUEERS!Get ready for a high-energy night of legendary punk rock as BLACK FLAG hits the stage in Downtown St. Pete! Widely considered one of the most important and influential bands in American punk history, BLACK FLAG helped launch the hardcore movement with their raw sound, fearless lyrics, and do-it-yourself spirit. Tracks like Rise Above and My War became rallying cries for a generation.Sharing the stage are longtime punk favorites THE QUEERS, known for their catchy melodies, surf-inspired riffs, and energetic live shows that have won over fans around the world. With decades of touring and a dedicated following, they bring the perfect mix of fun and fire to this all-ages celebration of punk rock history.Dont miss this epic night with two iconic bands who helped shape the undergroundand are still bringing the noise today.Fergs Concert Pavilion is located at: 1320 Central Avenue in Downtown St. Petersburg, Florida directly across the street from Tropicana Field where you can park at The Trops massive parking lot for all Fergs shows for one low dough day/night fee!Fergs Opens Daily at 11AM with Live Music 6 Nights A Week! Come Hang Out and Party Like A Rock Star every day and night at Fergss!Fergs Concert Pavilion (Concert Nights)Box Office: 5PMGates: 6PMShow: 7PMRain or Shine EventAll Ages WelcomeNo Pets Please!!!Its not fair to them for both their general safety and small furry ears.TICKET OPTIONS FOR THIS SHOWGENERAL ADMISSION: Tickets allow for entry to the show and Fergs outdoor concert pavilions GA courtyard standing room section. VIP SEATED: Tickets allow entry to the show and Fergs outdoor concert pavilions VIP SEATED courtyard section and for this show seats will be close to the main stage on the left and right of the main stage in front of house. RESERVED VIP PUNK ROCK CONCERT DECK INCLUDES 20 TICKETS (1 ONLY) allows for entry to the show and our venues exclusive reserved elevated party deck section with incredible lines of sight to the main stage for both You and 19 of your friends, family and guests for incredible concert experience during the show. RESERVED VIP also comes with a dedicated Fergs server for ordering food and drinks during the show. Bottle service and catering options are also available. Please contact the venue via email or text (see below) for more details and all RESERVED VIP food and beverage options. ADDITIONAL IMPORTANT NOTES: Fergs Restaurant and Bars will be open both before and after the show and will provide additional areas for sitting, eating and drinking during the event for all ticket holders on a first come first served basis. For additional show or venue questions and needs please contact:FergsConcertQuestions@Gmail.com727.304.5689 (text only)	1035852752	https://www.bandsintown.com/e/1035852752?app_id=51fbb96b1e0a3466197c51b74bc89eac&came_from=267&utm_medium=api&utm_source=public_api&utm_campaign=event	2025-10-24 12:22:06	2025-10-24 12:36:24	{"Black Flag"}	7686	t
4587794	2026-01-23 20:00:00	Performing Live:\n  BLACK FLAG\nPlus guests, TBA!\nIf unbridled anger and unfocussed rebellion have a soundtrack, it's Black Flag. Primarily the brainchild of songwriter/guitarist Greg Ginn, Black Flag welded the heaviest metal to avant-jazz's noisy atonality powered by the full-tilt rhythms of the highest energy punk. Black Flag completely made mincemeat out of punk's boundaries and are frequently hailed as being Americas first hardcore band. Now, Black Flag is officially turning the page and beginning a bold new chapter with the addition of three new members: Max Zanelly (vocals), David Rodriguez (bass), and Bryce Weston (drums), joining founding guitarist Greg Ginn.\nAn Evening with Black Flag will showcase the chemistry and talent of the revitalized lineup, giving fans a first taste of the new era while also reliving the bands classic hits with 2 full sets of pure Black Flag!\nhardcore. punk.\ndoors @ 8pm;\nshow @ 8:30pm.\nall ages.\n$30 advance;\n$43 day of show.\nBuy tickets: https://www.dnalounge.com/calendar/2026/01-23.html\nWatch and listen:\n  Black Flag: Louie Louie: https://youtu.be/rrkoBKiqzqE	1036370245	https://www.bandsintown.com/e/1036370245?app_id=51fbb96b1e0a3466197c51b74bc89eac&came_from=267&utm_medium=api&utm_source=public_api&utm_campaign=event	2025-10-24 12:22:06	2025-10-24 12:36:24	{"Black Flag"}	7686	t
