4588550	2025-11-08 21:00:00	Pisces Music presents\nSECRET PSYCHEDELICA: SCORPIO\nAbove DNA:\n  Vision Quest\n  Omega11xx\n  Devon\n  Dropper\n  Michael Liu\nDazzle Room:\n  Tim Brown\n  DJ Clairity\n  Bret Slaughter\n  Doc Brown\n  Dom1\nA powerful night awaits at Secret Psychedelica's 5th annual Scorpio psytrance soiree! Dive into the deep, hypnotic realms of psychedelic trance as Pluto's influence guides us into the unknown. Our loyal nest of Scorpio DJs will be joined by Vision Quest of GreenTree Records (Missouri) in the psytrance sanctum while North Bay's Higher Conscience residents return to San Francisco to take over the house and techno sanctuary.\nEmerging from the mysterious and swampy depths of southeast Missouri, Vision Quest brings forth a signature style of music rooted in progressive psytrance and forged over a transformative 15-year odyssey through numerous genres. His sets are a masterful blend of electronic and acoustic elements that flow through dynamic emotional landscapes, from uplifting melodies to high-energy bangers, fulfilling a soulful connection that Scorpios crave. Recently signed to Belgium's GreenTree Records, Vision Quest is on a mission to share purpose, strength, and understanding, continuing to elevate the psychedelic trance experience for fans around the world.\nSecret Psychedelica's Scorpio residents Devon and Omega11xx along with Dropper of Thought Society will get things started in the psytrance room. Devon discovered Goa trance in 1997 which led him down the path of DJing, event promotions, and eventually to his current job as manager of a world renown club in San Francisco. His musical tastes would expand past psychedelic trance and Devon would go on to start the monthly parties Meat and Turbo Drive which pushed the heavy beats of industrial music and the retro sounds of synthwave respectively. Omega11xx is back for his fourth straight Scorpio appearance and will command the depths of electronic sound with unwavering intensity, weaving decades of mastery into an immersive journey through full-on psy. This trailblazer's magnetic energy transcends the dance floor, forging a legacy of unforgettable experiences. Making his Secret Psychedelica debut, Dropper, a veteran of the West Coast underground, is primed to blast a hypnotic blend of futuristic and nostalgic sounds to keep the audience locked in a mind-bending groove. Wielding elegant yet powerful precision skills in mixing, his talents as an audio orchestrator landed him residencies with Thought Society and Acid Totem.\nThis second room will host a Higher Conscience takeover with an all Scorpio lineup of their own! The collective brings in Tim Brown of InStereo Recordings with Bret Slaughter and Doc Brown from the North Bay to throw down funky bass lines smothered in groovy and uplifting melodies. They are paired with the City's DJ Clairity of Isolator and Fast Forward recording artist Dom1 for a dynamic adventure from techno to house music.\nJoin us as we descend into an evening of sonic ecstasy, curated by those as determined and passionate as the scorpion itself.\nBuy tickets: https://www.dnalounge.com/calendar/2025/11-08d.html\nWatch and listen:\n  Secret Psychedelica: https://youtu.be/4n1ZXmtaXyo\npsytrance. techno. house.\n9pm - 2am.\n18+ with ID.\n$11, $14 limited advance;\n$18 after;\n$25 door.	1036934366	https://www.bandsintown.com/e/1036934366?app_id=51fbb96b1e0a3466197c51b74bc89eac&came_from=267&utm_medium=api&utm_source=public_api&utm_campaign=event	2025-10-24 12:24:01	2025-10-24 12:36:34	{droppER}	10658	t
