4588610	2026-03-28 19:00:00	🚀 Dub Pistols – Enter The Tour 2026 🚀\nFrom their roots in the 90s big beat explosion to becoming one of the UK’s most electrifying live bands, Dub Pistols have spent nearly three decades fusing dub, ska, hip-hop, reggae, jungle, and drum & bass into their unmistakable sound. With ten albums, countless festival appearances, and a reputation for chaos-driven live shows, Barry Ashworth and the Pistols remain unstoppable.\nNow they’re stepping into a new chapter with Enter The Tour – the band’s first ever self-promoted tour. Independent and straight from the source, this run promises to be one of their wildest yet. Expect special guests throughout, fresh tracks from their new album Enter The Sound, and all the heavy bass, blazing brass, and high-energy madness that makes the Dub Pistols legendary.\nTICKET INFO\nYou can sign up to our mailing list to get early access tickets, guaranteeing a ticket ALSO at a discount for 48 hours before general sale.\nIf you're not already on the mailing list sign up here - https://dubpistolsmusic.co.uk/home/\nSet your alarm - priority access tickets: Saturday 6th September 10am.\nAny tickets remaining for any shows will be available at full price from Monday 8th September 10am.\n🌟 Career Highlights\nFestival legends at Glastonbury, Boomtown, Bestival, Electric Castle, Beat Hearder + more\n10 studio albums, from 1998’s Point Blank to 2025’s Enter The Sound\nCollaborations with Terry Hall (The Specials), Horace Andy (Massive Attack), Rodney P, Akala + more\nHuge remixes for Moby, The Crystal Method, and Ian Brown\nFounders of their own festival, Mucky Weekender\nChampions of mental health advocacy through Barry Ashworth’s Flying Circus\n🔥 What to Expect on Enter The Tour\n✅ Bass-heavy beats, brass-fuelled chaos, and full-throttle energy 🎺🔥\n✅ New music from Enter The Sound alongside festival anthems 🎶\n✅ Special guests and surprise collaborations 🤝\n✅ A DIY, independent tour that puts fans front and centre 🚀\n💥 Be part of the chaos.	107339063	https://www.bandsintown.com/e/107339063?app_id=51fbb96b1e0a3466197c51b74bc89eac&came_from=267&utm_medium=api&utm_source=public_api&utm_campaign=event	2025-10-24 12:24:09	2025-10-24 12:36:34	{"Dub Pistols"}	7563	t
