4589321	2026-01-26 10:00:00	<p>Greenstone Entertainment are proud to present the 16th anniversary of the Summer Concert Tour returning across 3 venues in January 2026</p><p>The original &lsquo;wild one&rsquo; of rock, IGGY POP along with the Queen of Rock JOAN JETT and THE BLACKHEARTS, HOODOO GURUS and Kiwi favourites, ZED will headline the Summer Concert Tour.</p><p>The Summer Concert tour will hit Taupo&rsquo;s Amphitheatre on Auckland Anniversary Weekend Saturday, January 24 and Whitianga&rsquo;s Sherriff Block Arena on Monday, January 26 with the final destination at Wānaka&rsquo;s Three Parks Outdoor Arena on Saturday, January 31.</p><p>Considered by many the &lsquo;Godfather of Punk&rsquo; Iggy Pop is widely acknowledged as one of THE most dynamic stage performers of all time. He has built a legendary career filled with both critical acclaim and fanatic cult success.</p><p>Iggy Pop said; &ldquo;I am knocked out by the chance to come and rock hard and enjoy the incredible summer in beautiful New Zealand; mountains, lakes, beaches and good times, oh hell yeah! I am bringing the world&#39;s greatest rock band and a full bag of everything I know how to do, and the songs I can offer, from hard rock to rock pop.&rdquo;</p><p>Described as the &ldquo;Queen of Rock &lsquo;n&rsquo; Roll&rdquo; and &ldquo;Godmother of Punk&rdquo;, Joan Jett is celebrated for her rebellious spirit, fierce performances, and raw powerful music.</p><p>&ldquo;It&rsquo;s been a little while since I&rsquo;ve been to New Zealand and I&rsquo;m thrilled to perform for the fans there, really looking forward to it!&rdquo; said Joan Jett.</p><p>Formed in Sydney in 1981, the Hoodoo Gurus hold a singular place in Australian and indeed international Rock &lsquo;n&rsquo; Roll history. Renowned for their inventive and witty songwriting, dynamic live shows, and fusion of garage rock, pop and psychedelia.</p><p>ZED were an essential part of the soundtrack to New Zealand life between 1999 and 2004, amassing an impressive ten Top 40 hits during the height of their career. The band &mdash; still performing with their original line-up &mdash; has matured into a powerhouse live act.</p><p>Greenstone Entertainment is dedicated to bringing the best live music experiences to New Zealand, creating unforgettable festivals held in breathtaking locations across the country. Known for showcasing world-class talent in stunning outdoor venues, Greenstone Entertainment continues to set the standard for premier concert experiences in New Zealand. Over half a million music fans have enjoyed a Summer Concert Tour over 16 years.</p><p><br></p><p style='margin:0cm;font-size:15px;font-family:"Aptos",sans-serif;'><strong><span style='font-size:14px;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:black;background:white;'>Children&rsquo;s Policy</span></strong><span style='font-size:14px;font-family:"Calibri",sans-serif;color:black;background:white;'><br>&nbsp;- Children aged 14 years (inclusive) and under (as at Concert Date) are admitted free of charge to the General Admission areas of the Concert Site(s).<br>&nbsp;- Children who are 15 years of age and over (as Concert Date) are to buy a Concert Ticket (as required)<br>&nbsp;- You will be required to present proof of age for all children aged 14 years and under (As at Concert Date). Children MUST be accompanied by a responsible adult at all times. All Children Under 18 Years of Age (Minors) must be accompanied at all times in the Concert Site by a responsible adult, parent or guardian.<br>&nbsp;* Excl access to Corporate , VIP and Greenstone Club areas.</span></p>	1036900461	https://www.bandsintown.com/e/1036900461?app_id=51fbb96b1e0a3466197c51b74bc89eac&came_from=267&utm_medium=api&utm_source=public_api&utm_campaign=event	2025-10-24 12:26:02	2025-10-24 12:36:41	{"Hoodoo Gurus","Joan Jett and the Blackhearts","Iggy Pop","The Summer Concert Tour",Zed}	6561	t
