4591087	2025-11-01 15:00:00	We have news! News of two special London shows, on 1 November at the Barbican, to be more precise. We'll be playing songs from The Last Flight, plus a selection of reworked others (other hits, we mean), alongside a 20-piece string section from the London Contemporary Orchestra, who recorded the strings for the album itself.\n\nThere are two performances, one at 3pm and one at 8pm, and the age limit is 5+ (with responsible adult) so it's a relatively rare opportunity for nearly all ages to come along and watch us, in the beautiful surroundings of the Barbican Hall.\n	106868741	https://www.bandsintown.com/e/106868741?app_id=51fbb96b1e0a3466197c51b74bc89eac&came_from=267&utm_medium=api&utm_source=public_api&utm_campaign=event	2025-10-24 12:29:50	2025-10-24 12:37:04	{"Public Service Broadcasting"}	8504	t
