4592474	2025-11-28 19:00:00	Iconic. Legendary. Surreal. Sublime.\n\nCome celebrate The Church’s incredible songbook on:\nThe Singles Tour: A Career Retrospective\n\nFormed many lifetimes ago (well, 1980) The Church has earned a rightfully revered place in Australian rock music history along with a thoroughly deserved place in the ARIA Hall Of Fame. The Church continue to create timeless music that deeply resonates with audiences worldwide. From their early days in Sydney’s underground scene to their global overground success, The Church remain one of the most innovative and enduring bands of their…or any…era.\n\nEverybody knows the etheric majesty of their iconic hit Under The Milky Way (featured everywhere from moody cinema masterpiece Donnie Darko, to AFL Grand Finals and car ads) but behind ‘Milky Way’ lays a deep catalogue of emotive songwriting and genius performances.\n\nThe Singles Tour will be the first time ever The Church have played a show in this unique format celebrating their rare guitar brilliance and song writing invention. The tour will see them play 20 of their Classic Singles spanning their career including Under The Milky Way, Reptile, The Unguarded Moment, Tear it All Away, When You Were Mine, Almost With You, Electric Lash, It’s No Reason, Already Yesterday, Columbus, Tantalized, Metropolis, The Hypnogogue, Ripple and many others. With their distinctive sound blending psyche rock, atmospheric melodies, and soul-stirring lyrics, The Church promises a performance that will delight both longtime fans and recent converts.\n\nGuaranteed a timeless, transcendent experience - join The Church this November 2025 as they play their Classic Singles and Celebrate their career	106727379	https://www.bandsintown.com/e/106727379?app_id=51fbb96b1e0a3466197c51b74bc89eac&came_from=267&utm_medium=api&utm_source=public_api&utm_campaign=event	2025-10-24 12:32:28	2025-10-24 12:37:22	{"The Church"}	7017	t
