4593897	2026-02-09 19:30:00	<p style="text-align: center;"><strong><span style="font-size: 18px;">WET LEG</span></strong><br><strong>AUSTRALIAN MOISTOURIZER 2026</strong><br><strong>Presented by Secret Sounds &amp; triple j</strong></p><p style="text-align: center;"><strong>Wet Leg return to Australia in 2026 for exclusive headline shows</strong></p><p style="text-align: center;">Secret Sounds has today announced the highly-anticipated return of Grammy Award winning indie rockers <strong>WET LEG,&nbsp;</strong>for two exclusive Australian headline shows in February 2026. Wet Leg have built a legion of local fans since they dropped their self-titled debut album in April 2022, playing Splendour in the Grass and a series of accompanying shows that same year. These forthcoming tour dates will be their first showcasing material from new album <em>Moisturizer</em>, alongside fan favourites such as <em>Chaise Lounge</em>, <em>Being In Love</em> and <em>Wet Dream.</em></p><p style="text-align: center;">Wet Leg is riding high following the release of sophomore album <em>Moisturizer</em>, with its singles <em>CPR</em> and the frenetic, alluringly combative <em>Catch These Fists</em>. <em>Moisturizer</em> is defined by its sheer exuberance, the band turning the dial up with a record that is unapologetically bolder, stronger and raunchier than its predecessor. The band is currently playing a mammoth 22-stop North American moisTOURizer, followed by expansive European and UK dates, before heading to Australia in February.</p><p style="text-align: center;"><strong>TICKETS ON SALE THURSDAY, 9 OCTOBER AT 12PM</strong></p><p style="text-align: center;">Artist Presale: Wednesday, 8 October, 11am - Thursday, 9 October, 11am</p><p style="text-align: center;">Secret Sounds Presale: Wednesday, 8 October, 11am - Thursday, 9 October, 11am</p><p style="text-align: center;">All times are local.</p><p style="text-align: center;">For complete tour and ticket information, visit <a href="http://www.secretsounds.com/">secretsounds.com</a>.</p>	1036772285	https://www.bandsintown.com/e/1036772285?app_id=51fbb96b1e0a3466197c51b74bc89eac&came_from=267&utm_medium=api&utm_source=public_api&utm_campaign=event	2025-10-24 12:35:45	2025-10-24 12:37:43	{"wet leg"}	10360	t
