4587881	2026-02-04 19:00:00	<p><strong>with Special Guest: total tommy</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Los Angeles based Blondshell (Sabrina Teitelbaum) announces <strong>Australian Tour</strong> for February 2026.</p><p>Last in Australia in 2024 as part of Laneway Festival, <strong>Blondshell</strong> returns with headline shows in Sydney, Brisbane and Melbourne.</p><p><strong>Blondshell&nbsp;</strong>released her self-titled debut album in 2023 - an introspective, sharply specific record laced with nonchalant humour that quickly established her as one of the most acclaimed emerging artists in recent years. Follow up sophomore album, <strong>If You\nAsked For A Picture</strong> (out now via Mushroom Music, here) was released to worldwide acclaim, recently earning spots on both Rolling Stone and Consequence&rsquo;s lists of the best albums of 2025 so far.</p><p>Most recently, Blondshell released her moody and swoon-worthy reinterpretation of Addison Rae&rsquo;s <a href="https://youtu.be/vC4ywcAOCM8?si=Z1zaLfUv8AeiA4JK">&lsquo;Diet Pepsi (Live at Sirius XMU)&rsquo;</a> and performed for tens of thousands alongside Fontaines D.C. and Queens of the Stone Age in the UK and Europe. Blondshell is currently on the road with her &lsquo;If You Asked For A Tour&rsquo;, playing shows throughout 2025 across the US, UK and Europe before hitting Australia in February 2026!</p><p>an Alt-Rock Supernova&rsquo; - New York Times</p><p>&lsquo;Blondshell&rsquo;s sharp, secret-sharing (on) &lsquo;If You Asked for a Picture.&rsquo; - Rolling Stone <a href="https://www.rollingstone.com/music/music-lists/best-albums-2025-1235342974/blondshell-if-you-asked-for-a-picture-1235343131/">(The Best Albums of 2025 So Far)</a></p><p>&lsquo;Increasingly confident, self-assured musical language... swirling, shape-shifting\ntextures... enveloping and inviting&rsquo; - Pitchfork</p><p>Joining <strong>Blondshell&nbsp;</strong>on all shows is Sydney-based artist, singer, songwriter and Queer heartthrob <strong>total tommy</strong> (she/her).</p><p>Alt-pop star Blondshell brings her perfectly crafted songs and captivating live show back\nto Australia this summer.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>PRESALE TICKET LIMIT:&nbsp;</strong>There is a strict pre-sale limit of four (4) tickets per customer on this event. Persons who exceed the ticket limit may have any or all of their orders and tickets cancelled without notice. This includes orders associated with the same name, e-mail address, billing address, credit card number or other information.</p><p><strong>GENERAL PUBLIC TICKET LIMIT:&nbsp;</strong>There is a strict limit of eight (8) tickets per customer on this event. Persons who exceed the ticket limit may have any or all of their orders and tickets cancelled without notice. This includes orders associated with the same name, e-mail address, billing address, credit card number or other information.</p><p>https://www.frontiertouring.com/page/terms-of-sale</p>	1036529631	https://www.bandsintown.com/e/1036529631?app_id=51fbb96b1e0a3466197c51b74bc89eac&came_from=267&utm_medium=api&utm_source=public_api&utm_campaign=event	2025-10-24 12:22:14	2025-10-24 12:36:26	{Blondshell}	10407	t
