4588120	2025-10-31 19:00:00	Get ready for a Halloween night of face-melting riffs, wild costumes, and sweaty dancing at The Water Rats!\n\nCápsula – Legendary garage rockers from Buenos Aires, known for their explosive live shows and raw, psychedelic energy. With over two decades of international touring and collaborations with the likes of Ivan Julian (Richard Hell) and producer Tony Visconti (David Bowie), Cápsula deliver a high-octane blend of glam, punk, and space rock that’s impossible to ignore.\n\nSeven Red Lions – London-based “tequila rock” outfit mixing powerful alt-rock with Latin grooves, bluesy riffs, and plenty of swagger. SRL brings a fiery live presence and a sound that feels like Queens of the Stone Age took a road trip through Mexico. Expect passion, rhythm, and chaos — in the best way.\n\nThe Kid and I – High-energy indie rockers with a knack for catchy hooks, big choruses, and heart-on-sleeve lyrics. With influences from Biffy Clyro to Foo Fighters, their set is packed with dynamic twists and infectious energy that’ll have you shouting along by the second chorus.\n\nPURE JOY DJ – Keeping the party going, after the bands with a feel-good mix of funky disco rhythms and dancefloor bangers. Come for the live music, stay to dance like no one's watching.\n\nOh, and don’t forget — it’s a costume party! Whether you're creepy, cosmic, chaotic or cute, prizes await the best-dressed. Go big or go home.	107172757	https://www.bandsintown.com/e/107172757?app_id=51fbb96b1e0a3466197c51b74bc89eac&came_from=267&utm_medium=api&utm_source=public_api&utm_campaign=event	2025-10-24 12:22:39	2025-10-24 12:36:28	{"Capsula (Official)"}	7232	t
