4589911	2025-11-14 20:00:00	bar italia return with essential summer banger Cowbella and a slew of European and North American tour dates. The run of shows in October and November, including stops in London, Milan, Barcelona, Paris, Los Angeles, New York and Toronto, will follow a sold-out, small capacity London show previewing new music at 93 Feet East on June 19th. Tickets go on sale Friday, June 20th at 10am local time HERE. Cowbella, the first new music from the band since 2024s The Tw*ts EP, sees a transcendent vocal blunt rotation between members Nina Cristante, Jezmi Tarik Fehmi and Sam Fenton unfolding over a wiry, shapeshifting rocker that culminates in an explosive and chilling skywards coda. Its a multi-pronged anthem that only bar italia could conjure. The last two years have seen the London trio release two critically acclaimed albums on Matador only several months apart the poised Tracey Denim and the grand The Twits. Theyve traversed the globe with headline performances from Istanbul to Tokyo, sold-out multi-night stints in New York and Los Angeles, and festivals including Corona Capital, Glastonbury and Coachella. With over 160 shows worldwide across 2023-2024, bar italia became an exhibitionist and muscular five-piece equally comfortable at festival mosh-pit incitement and moments of pin-drop intimacy.	1036228097	https://www.bandsintown.com/e/1036228097?app_id=51fbb96b1e0a3466197c51b74bc89eac&came_from=267&utm_medium=api&utm_source=public_api&utm_campaign=event	2025-10-24 12:27:19	2025-10-24 12:36:50	{Lifeguard}	10608	t
