4591362	2025-11-07 21:00:00	Sarah McLachlan – Fumbling Towards Ecstasy 30th Anniversary Tour with special guest Tiny Habits Friday, November 7 SHOWTIME: 9 PM, DOORS OPEN: 8 PM  Tickets $65/$85/$99/$115/$125/$140 Follow Casino Rama Resort's social pages for the presale code.  Sarah McLachlan is one of the most celebrated singer/songwriters in entertainment with over 40 million albums sold worldwide. She has received three Grammy Awards and twelve Juno Awards over her career and has been inducted into the Canadian Music Hall of Fame. The Fumbling Towards Ecstasy 30th Anniversary Tour celebrates McLachlan’s highly acclaimed third studio album, which first released October 22, 1993. The album quickly topped the charts in Canada and went certified platinum within a few weeks, selling over 3 million copies worldwide to date. Hit singles include "Possession,” "Hold On," “Ice Cream,” and "Good Enough,” among others. The 30th anniversary tour will see McLachlan playing the beloved album in its entirety along with some of her most celebrated songs.  Note: Ticketmaster is the only authorized seller of Casino Rama Resort concert tickets.   *Must be twelve (12) years of age or older to enter the Entertainment Centre and nineteen (19) years of age or older with valid government issued photo ID; those twenty-one (21) years of age or younger must also have a secondary piece of name identification. Those who have been trespassed and/or self-excluded from Casino Rama Resort or any OLG property and/or fail to meet Casino Rama Resort’s conditions of entry may not visit, participate in promotions and/or redeem offers. Visit CasinoRama.com for conditions of entry. 	1035028054	https://www.bandsintown.com/e/1035028054?app_id=51fbb96b1e0a3466197c51b74bc89eac&came_from=267&utm_medium=api&utm_source=public_api&utm_campaign=event	2025-10-24 12:30:23	2025-10-24 12:37:10	{"Sarah McLachlan","Tiny Habits"}	10597	t
