-family:"Open Sans",sans-serif;color:#444444;'>Throwing Muses - featuring Kristin Hersh, David Narcizo and Bernard Georges - recently released new album &lsquo;Moonlight Concessions&rsquo; which has been described by Pitchfork Magazine as: &ldquo;A stunning return to form&rdquo;.</span></p><p style='margin-right:0cm;margin-left:0cm;font-size:16px;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;margin-top:15.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;background:white;'><span style='font-size:15px;font-family:"Open Sans",sans-serif;color:#444444;'>&lsquo;Moonlight Concessions&rsquo; goes back to basics, a return for Throwing Muses to their esoteric off-kilter best courtesy of Kristin&rsquo;s pin-sharp sketches and their suitably abrasive musical arrangements. The album follows &lsquo;Sun Racket&rsquo; from 2020, a heady set filled with tough and tender tales spiked with surreal imagery.</span></p><p style='margin-right:0cm;margin-left:0cm;font-size:16px;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;margin-top:15.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;background:white;'><span style='font-size:15px;font-family:"Open Sans",sans-serif;color:#444444;'>Don&#39;t miss Throwing Muses performing their career-spanning concerts in Auckland and Wellington in Decembe</span><span style='font-size:15px;font-family:"Open Sans",sans-serif;color:#444444;'>r.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style='font-size:15px;font-family:"Open Sans",sans-serif;color:#444444;'>Full tour information at&nbsp;</span><span style='font-size:16px;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;'><a href="http://Plus1.co.nz"><strong><span style='font-size:15px;font-family:"Open Sans",sans-serif;'>Plus1.co.nz</span></strong></a></span></p>	1035842947	https://www.bandsintown.com/e/1035842947?app_id=51fbb96b1e0a3466197c51b74bc89eac&came_from=267&utm_medium=api&utm_source=public_api&utm_campaign=event	2025-10-24 12:34:56	2025-10-24 12:37:39	{"Throwing Muses"}	5897	t
